{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The roads never end, and the traffic never stops. Your only goal: make it across.<br><br>Grab up to 5 friends and take on 12 chaotic levels, each packed with speeding cars, tricky hazards, and hidden secrets. Time your crossings carefully and try not to get flattened, though watching a friend get launched by a car might be the funniest part. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides collectible eggs for the curious, and over 20 hats can be unlocked as you play. Survive the roads, explore the levels, and show off your style.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010150?t=1759400867","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010150/01ebc1ff74510ea5c1cd6b23b7c777b8200df510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759400867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010150/568d6b23cbfd351327e16afc88bcd34f7fa2ab82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759400867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010150/568d6b23cbfd351327e16afc88bcd34f7fa2ab82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759400867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4059750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The roads never end, and the traffic never stops. Your only goal: make it across.<br><br>Grab up to 5 friends and take on 12 chaotic levels, each packed with speeding cars, tricky hazards, and hidden secrets. Time your crossings carefully and try not to get flattened, though watching a friend get launched by a car might be the funniest part. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides collectible eggs for the curi